      "message": "fix(contour): keep the source refusal inside the app API\n\nRemove the private motion validator call from the app's open-boundary\nstart refusal. That branch always returns the named source mapping error.\nAccepted and no-pick paths still enter the public chain generator, which\nperforms its existing validation.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>\n\nRefs #1473",
