        "date": "2026-11-28T03:52:13Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(contour): refresh endpoint picks against upstream main\n\nMerge upstream main 2394b5ad1efc573b7b99a898a02cc4225b4d9893 into\nthe issue branch after the independent contributor precheck.\n\nKeep the open-boundary source-pick guard before the avoid-aware dispatch.\nKeep the stock source-pick guard in the public wrapper after its helper\nvalidates the run, chooses its side, offsets it and checks part clearance.\nRetain both upstream avoid routing and the natural endpoint law.\n\nPreserve upstream process version166 and its process content. The net\ndiff against upstream is limited to the12 issue files. The two hand\nresolutions are DELTA and require independent final-head verification.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>\n\nRefs #1473",
